@startuml
title Включение отопления. Диаграмма последовательности

actor Пользователь as user
participant "API Gateway" as gateway
participant "Heating Service" as heating
participant "Device Service" as device
database "Heating DB" as db
queue "MQTT брокер" as mqtt
participant "Модуль отопления" as module

user -> gateway: POST /heating/{device_id}/commands
gateway -> heating: POST /heating/{device_id}/commands
heating -> device: GET /devices/{device_id}
device --> heating: устройство
heating -> db: сохранить команду
heating -> mqtt: команда turn_on
heating --> gateway: 202 Accepted
gateway --> user: 202 Accepted
mqtt -> module: команда turn_on
module -> mqtt: новое состояние
mqtt -> heating: новое состояние
heating -> db: обновить состояние
@enduml
